I am Dr. Khouloud Abid, a Postdoctoral Researcher at CNR-ITAE,
Messina, Italy.

I obtained double doctoral degrees in Engineering in Chemistry
and Materials Construction from the University of Messina, Italy,
and in Physics from the University of Sfax, Tunisia.

My research focuses on:

- Two-dimensional materials (Graphene, MoS2, MoSe2, WS2)
- Electrochemical sensors
- Plasmonic sensing (SERS, PIERS, TERS)
- Environmental monitoring
- CO₂ capture materials
- Thermochemical energy storage

My expertise includes synthesis, functionalization,
and advanced characterization of nanomaterials.
